  "instructions": [
    "Press tofu for 15 minutes to remove excess water, then cut into 1.5-inch cubes.",
    "Heat one tablespoon olive oil in a pot over medium heat and sauté diced onion, carrot, and celery for 5 minutes until fragrant.",
    "Add minced garlic and ginger and cook for another 1 minute.",
    "Pour in one cup whole milk and bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Add soy sauce, fish sauce, and a pinch of salt; stir well.",
    "Gently fold in tofu cubes and simmer for 10 minutes, allowing the tofu to absorb the flavors.",
    "Season with pepper; adjust salt as needed.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh basil or parsley for a grassy finish."
